        "url": "/medias/politique-qualite",
        "shortDescription": "<p><span dir=\"ltr\"></span>Exonetik's purpose is to push back the limits of synergy between humans and machines.</p>",
        "banner": "https://s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/exonetik/assets-prod/assets/Thumb_mark-of-trust-certified-ISO-9001-quality-management-systems-black-logo-En-GB-1019-Copy_2024-10-28-144819_ettk.jpg",
        "content": [
            {
                "type": "text",
                "sectionTitle": null,
                "text": "<strong>EXONETIK IS COMMITTED TO :</strong><br />\n<br />\nGuaranteeing customer satisfaction with proposed ideas through unparalleled collaboration<br />\nProviding opportunities for our customers to stand out in the marketplace through exceptional technology.<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<strong>TO MEET THESE COMMITMENTS, EXONETIK'S APPROACH IS TO :</strong><br />\n<br />\n- Implementing rigorous and effective quality management processes and systems that are constantly being improved.<br />\n<br />\n- Comply with all applicable laws and regulations.<br />\n<br />\n- Maintain a safe and healthy working environment for our employees.<br />\n<br />\n- Communicate openly and honestly with all our stakeholders, including employees, customers and suppliers.<br />\n<br />\n- Promote employee engagement through a friendly atmosphere that encourages talent collaboration, while preserving work-life balance.<br />\n<br />\n<br />\nWe have been ISO 9001:2015 certified since December 2023."
